// Map rotation for this server. Edit this file to change maps and modes; AMP never overwrites it.
// AMP writes the other settings to amp_server.cfg, which runs this file last before hosting,
// so any setting placed here overrides the AMP value.
//
// Format: MapRotation.AddMap <MAP> <MODE> [tl=<minutes>] [sl=<score>]
// Maps: RIVIERA, COMPOUND, RAILYARD, VILLAGE, DOCKYARD, URBAN, BUNKER, FORTRESS, "NIGHT WOODS", MARINA
// Modes: DM, TDM, DK (Distance King), TDK (Team Distance King), NC (No Cross), CL (Control),
//        LMS (Last Man Standing), CTF (Capture the Flag). NC is not available on DOCKYARD, URBAN, BUNKER or MARINA.
// With Map Vote enabled, only the first map is used; players vote on the rest.
// Rule presets and map lists: exec Docs/ExampleConfigs/Preset_Hardcore.cfg (see Docs/Command Reference.pdf).

MapRotation.AddMap DOCKYARD TDM
MapRotation.AddMap COMPOUND TDM
MapRotation.AddMap MARINA TDM
MapRotation.AddMap RIVIERA TDM
MapRotation.AddMap RAILYARD TDM
MapRotation.AddMap VILLAGE TDM
